{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddfc <strong>Cleaning Has Never Been This Fun!</strong> \ud83e\uddfd<br>Dusty desks, dirty walls, messy rooms\u2026 They\u2019re all waiting for you!<br>Become the hero of hygiene with <i><strong>Cleaning Simulator</strong></i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/cikcik1.gif?t=1745191164\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This simulator is packed with realistic environments, satisfying cleaning effects, and tons of cleaning equipment\u2014both relaxing and addictively fun. Move furniture into an empty house, or sterilize homes left in disarray\u2014each task sharpens your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf9 Grab your mop, prep your bucket, and start scrubbing!<br>\ud83e\uddfa Organize furniture, collect trash, wash the dishes!<br>\ud83c\udfc6 Complete tasks to unlock new locations and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleaning isn\u2019t just a chore\u2014it\u2019s an experience that turns into art!<br>If you're ready, it\u2019s time to change the world with your mop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/bulasikmak.gif?t=1745191164\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed with <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>, <i>Cleaning Simulator</i> takes lighting quality to a whole new level with <strong>Ray Tracing </strong>and <strong>HDR</strong> support\u2014offering a realistic experience for all cleanliness enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/GrafikKalitesi.png?t=1745191164\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537950?t=1745191164","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.